  Surgeons CDN Image Helper — LOCKED ENABLED 2026-04-08
  CBD Surgeons & Surgeons, LLC / surgeonsolution.io
  Operator: Ryan Bolda, 130 Dickinson St, Mount Clemens, MI 48043

  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  This helper returns a fully-qualified surgeons-ai CDN URL. It is the single
  source of truth for the CDN base URL, so the base can be changed in one
  place when surgeonsolution.io migrates off Shopify onto the surgeons-ai
  infrastructure.

  Backend: https://ai.surgeonsolutions.org/cdn/{category}/{filename}
  (Static file server — see C:\surgeons-ai\srgn-server\routes\cdn-routes.ts)

  IMPORTANT: the backend is a STATIC file server. It does NOT perform
  on-the-fly image transforms. Width/height/quality/format parameters below
  are ACCEPTED but IGNORED today — reserved for future backend transform
  support. Callers must pre-optimize and pre-size their files before
  uploading via POST /api/v1/cdn/upload.

  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  Usage patterns:

  1. Reference an asset already on the surgeons-ai CDN:
     {%- render 'surgeons-cdn-image', cdn_path: 'products/gummy-bears-800.webp' -%}
     Returns: https://ai.surgeonsolutions.org/cdn/products/gummy-bears-800.webp

  2. Fallback: if no cdn_path is given, return src unchanged:
     {%- render 'surgeons-cdn-image', src: product.featured_image -%}
     Returns: whatever src was (typically a Shopify CDN URL)

  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  DO NOT revert to `{% raw %}{% assign cdn_live = false %}{% endraw %}` or
  restore the old cdn.surgeonsolutions.org base. That subdomain never
  existed and the old path-shape (`?w=X&h=Y&q=Z&f=auto`) was never
  implemented on the backend.
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign cdn_base = 'https://ai.surgeonsolutions.org/cdn/' -%}

{%- if cdn_path != blank -%}
  {{- cdn_base | append: cdn_path -}}
{%- elsif src != blank -%}
  {{- src -}}
{%- endif -%}
